{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08687","headline":"宿鰕湖 · 李白","name":"宿鰕湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸡鸣发黄山，暝投鰕湖宿。\n白雨暎寒山，森森似银竹。\n提携采铅客，结荷水边沐。\n半夜四天开，星河烂人目。\n明晨大楼去，冈陇多屈伏。\n当与持斧翁，前溪伐云木。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08687.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08687","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}